{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 1590,
  "hub_id": 2175,
  "guid": "com.epicrangetime.rainbow",
  "name": "WTT - Taste the Rainbow",
  "slug": "wtt-taste-the-rainbow",
  "teaser": "Lancer mags in every color of the rainbow!",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/j8zpxWeIqNNQ6NW3omPDQthCH5rzucSTq4nOZJ8s.png",
  "downloads": 10466,
  "favourites_count": 20,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Hey guys,</p>\n<p>This mod adds the whole suite of 5.56 lancer mags to the game. Every single color featured on their website. 10s, 20s, and 30s. Enjoy!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/5XTQkYW8/M4-Smoke-Lancer.png\" alt=\"M4-Smoke-Lancer.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Cpy4LtD2/MDR-Lancer.png\" alt=\"MDR-Lancer.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/21jZYryb/WOS-Lancer.png\" alt=\"WOS-Lancer.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nqkWmXz2/M4-Blue-Lancer.png\" alt=\"M4-Blue-Lancer.png\" /></p>\n<p>CREDITS</p>\n<p>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>Many thanks to GrooveypenguinX who not only provided the codebase but directly helped me clean up my mod from the way it used to be. (Horrible mess, really)</p>\n<p>Thank you to Tron for teaching me most of what I know about processing these assets into usable formats for tarkov, as well as Pettan for your admonishments in my mistakes.</p>\n<p>Moxopixel for being a wealth of knowledge in the texturing department, I could not have done half of this without seeing what you’ve done.</p>\n<p>Credit to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/designers/cannuccia\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Cannuccia</a> for the amazing models.</p>\n<p>Many thanks to my Ko-Fi supporters for the help:</p>\n<p>Bloo</p>\n<p>Ehtacs</p>\n<p>Nazlug</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/epicrangetime\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FJQ7qzB/kofi-bg-tag-dark.webp\" alt=\"kofi-bg-tag-dark.webp\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How To Install and Compatibility</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>How to install:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the 7z file with the 7zip</li>\n<li>Place the folder inside into your SPT folder</li>\n<li>Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Compatibility:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No incompatibilities known</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The standard way to troubleshoot this mod is as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>If you have issues when you install this mod, try making a new profile (preferably a dev bear profile) and make sure your game works. I do this by standard with my mod prior to release anyways, so it should always work.</li>\n<li>Add your previously used mods and boot the game and run a raid after each installed mod. This is to see if anything is conflicting with my mod. Tell me what is conflicting and what your error message is so that I can verify whether it can be fixed or if it just needs to be added to incompatibilities.</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is WTT?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>What is Welcome To Tarkov?</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov (WTT) is a mod for SPT AKI that has been in development for over a year. What started as a small passion project has grown in size to incorporate 10+ core members as well as contributions from other well-known mod authors and friends of WTT alike.</p>\n<p><strong>How does Welcome To Tarkov change the game?</strong></p>\n<p>As a mod, WTT overhauls SPT AKI, touching on almost every vanilla game system, as well as adding completely new systems to the game and its core mechanics. Inspired by open-world hardcore survival projects like STALKER: Anomaly and STALKER: GAMMA, WTT takes SPT’s artificial multiplayer MMO difficulty adders and replaces them with a challenging world economy, loot scarcity rebalancing, a lore friendly quest overhaul, and a map-traveling system built from rewritten portions of the Traveler mod allowing seamless travel between maps. Aside from its changes to the game’s core properties, WTT also adds to the world’s variety of traders, NPC’s, characters, items, and quests:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Over 500 custom bundles adding new weapons, attachments, wearables, containers, food, medical, and barter items.</li>\n<li>New bosses with their own custom gear that will be properly incorporated into WTT’s quest lines.</li>\n<li>New, meaningful traders with their own lore-friendly quests and narrative elements to help the player progress through the story-line of WTT.</li>\n<li>New playable characters and outfits that will add to the player’s customization abilities.</li>\n<li>New quest types incorporating brand new map extraction points, putting the player’s knowledge and familiarization of SPT’s maps to the test.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Welcome To Tarkov stands as one of the largest mods created for SPT AKI thus far.</p>\n<p><strong>When does Welcome To Tarkov release?</strong></p>\n<p><em>Thursday.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Which Thursday?</strong></p>\n<p><em>TBD</em></p>\n<p><strong>Want to follow our progress?</strong></p>\n<p>You can follow the project through it’s development in our discord here:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
